<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Tegkor ups yr shr, div.</title>
<headline>Tegkor ups yr shr, div.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31, 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr, (cts)</p>
<p>    - pre except	    240.9	 vs 185.1</p>
<p>    - post except	   274.6	 vs 184.4</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		  49.94	vs  40.58</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   457.0	 vs 307</p>
<p>Dividends were paid in October and February</p>
<p>Full name: Technical Investment Corporation Ltd (Tegkor)</p>
<p>NOTE - Tegkor is an investment company which derives its income from its 20.7 percent stake in Rembrandt Group Ltd .</p>
